# Large genotype binary files intentionally excluded from this archive
# (documented in README.md — available on request)
# NOTE: do NOT use a bare *.bed glob — small interval-track .bed files
# (lmd_lead_snps.bed, lmd_loci.bed) ARE included and must be tracked.
lmd.phe.bed
lmd.phe_qc.bed
lmd.qc.bed
*.bim
*.grm.bin
*.grm.N.bin
*.nosex

# Derived large files (regenerable from the included .assoc.linear / .mlma)
lmd.gwas_with_features.txt
lmd.freq.frq

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
